          "end": 9.68,
          "en": "I'll create a new subfolder which I will name UI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.54,
          "end": 14.54,
          "en": "because I wanna store some general UI components in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.54,
          "end": 19.03,
          "en": "And my card should be one of those general components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.03,
          "end": 22.34,
          "en": "So in there I'll add a BaseCard.vue file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.34,
          "end": 25.51,
          "en": "following this Vue style guide recommendation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.61,
          "end": 29.47,
          "en": "and in here we now need a template of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.47,
          "end": 31.38,
          "en": "Now how should a card look like?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.38,
          "end": 33.9,
          "en": "What should a card component do?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.9,
          "end": 35.41,
          "en": "It's a very simple component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.41,
          "end": 38.92,
          "en": "It will have no logic attached to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.92,
          "end": 43.01,
          "en": "It's just about being a wrapper to other content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.01,
          "end": 45.36,
          "en": "which then has a certain look.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.36,
          "end": 48.343,
          "en": "And for that in this template, I'll just add a Div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.56,
          "end": 51.6,
          "en": "opening and closing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.6,
          "end": 54.263,
          "en": "and then provide a certain styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.44,
          "end": 61.16,
          "en": "So for that, I'm again adding my scoped styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.16,
          "end": 65.25,
          "en": "and attach to find the BaseCard CSS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.25,
          "end": 68.24,
          "en": "which as before contains the styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.24,
          "end": 71.88,
          "en": "the CSS rules you wanna add between your style text here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.88,
          "end": 73.713,
          "en": "in the BaseCard.vue file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 75.23,
          "end": 77.56,
          "en": "This will style the div in a certain way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 77.56,
          "end": 79.913,
          "en": "but now one important thing is missing here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 81.07,
          "end": 84.82,
          "en": "I mentioned that this card should be usable as a wrapper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.82,
          "end": 87.1,
          "en": "around any content we want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 87.1,
          "end": 89.92,
          "en": "and Vue has a built-in feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.92,
          "end": 94.64,
          "en": "that makes building such components easy slots.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.64,
          "end": 98.3,
          "en": "So here I will add a slot now between those divs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.3,
          "end": 101.53,
          "en": "so that we can feed in any markup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 101.53,
          "end": 104.21000000000001,
          "en": "any HTML code of our choice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 104.21000000000001,
          "end": 107.72999999999999,
          "en": "and it will be wrapped by this div with this style,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 107.72999999999999,
          "end": 108.93299999999999,
          "en": "that's the idea.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 110.11,
          "end": 112.53999999999999,
          "en": "Now we don't need to give this slot a name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 112.53999999999999,
          "end": 115.17,
          "en": "because it's the only slot here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.17,
          "end": 118.87,
          "en": "and with that we can now go to the LearningResource",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 118.87,
          "end": 121.37,
          "en": "where I wanna use that card",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 121.37,
          "end": 125.913,
          "en": "and replace this div here with that base-card.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.85,
          "end": 129.77,
          "en": "And actually here, I just noticed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129.77,
          "end": 131.86,
          "en": "the div was placed incorrectly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 131.86,
          "end": 134.47,
          "en": "The div should of course wrap all the content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.47,
          "end": 135.95,
          "en": "inside of the list item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 135.95,
          "end": 139.63,
          "en": "So it wraps the header, the paragraph and the nav here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 139.63,
          "end": 143.78300000000002,
          "en": "That's all part of this base-card.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.81,
          "end": 147.76,
          "en": "But, wait a second,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 147.76,
          "end": 150.66,
          "en": "is base-card available already?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 150.66,
          "end": 153.61,
          "en": "It's not because we haven't registered it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 153.61,
          "end": 155.12,
          "en": "Now since we're using it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.12,
          "end": 157.47,
          "en": "in the LearningResource.vue file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.47,
          "end": 160.653,
          "en": "we could of course add it as a local component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.49,
          "end": 164.64,
          "en": "but this BaseCard component will probably be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 164.64,
          "end": 167.4,
          "en": "in other parts of the application as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 167.4,
          "end": 170.53,
          "en": "Therefore, adding it as a global component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 170.53,
          "end": 172.75,
          "en": "might make more sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 172.75,
          "end": 176.42000000000002,
          "en": "And in general, these base components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.42000000000002,
          "end": 178.76,
          "en": "will typically be global components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 178.76,
          "end": 181.9,
          "en": "because typically being based components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 181.9,
          "end": 184.18,
          "en": "they will be used multiple times",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 184.18,
          "end": 186.053,
          "en": "in different parts of your app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 187.46,
          "end": 189.91,
          "en": "So therefore I'll go to main.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 189.91,
          "end": 192.77,
          "en": "and I will import BaseCard there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 192.77,
          "end": 197.77,
          "en": "from ./components/UI/BaseCard.vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 199.48,
          "end": 203.86,
          "en": "And now store my created app here in a constant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 203.86,
          "end": 205.34,
          "en": "so that on this app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 205.34,
          "end": 208.37,
          "en": "I can then all the conveniently call component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 208.37,
          "end": 212.52,
          "en": "and register the base-card HTML element name",
